p.p50,5)) err\\n FROM orders o JOIN recv rv ON rv.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id AND rv.rq>=o.quantity\\n JOIN shipn sn ON sn.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id LEFT JOIN trp tp ON tp.route_id=o.route_id WHERE o.is_effective=1)\\nSELECT m, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(MIN(err),1) mn,\\n ROUND(MAX(CASE WHEN rn=CAST(nn*0.5 AS INT)+1 THEN err END),2) p50,\\n ROUND(MAX(CASE WHEN rn=CAST(nn*0.75 AS INT)+1 THEN err END),2) p75,\\n ROUND(MAX(CASE WHEN rn=CAST(nn*0.9 AS INT)+1 THEN err END),2) p90,\\n ROUND(MAX(CASE WHEN rn=nn THEN err END),1) mx\\nFROM (SELECT m,err,ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY m ORDER BY err) rn, COUNT(*) OVER (PARTITION BY m) nn FROM base) GROUP BY m\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-18T00:11:02.254364", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_1391afb3651f4e748ca37ecf", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "route_name | transport_mode | baseline_transit_days | n | mn | p50 | p90 | mx\n----------------------------------------\n华东公路 | 公路 | 3 | 241 | 2.0 | 3.0 | 10.0 | 10.0\n华南公路 | 公路 | 2 | 185 | 1.0 | 2.0 | 9.0 | 9.0\n其他国内公路 | 公路 | 5 | 175 | 4.0 | 6.0 | 12.0 | 12.0\n国际海运 | 海运 | 22 | 116 | 20.0 | 25.0 | 36.0 | 36.0\n港澳陆运 | 陆运 | 4 | 7 | 3.0 | 4.0 | 6.0 | 6.0\n(5 rows)\n=== err quantiles by mode (pred = SHIP plan + transit p50) ===\nm | n | mn | p50 | p75 | p90 | mx\n----------------------------------------\n外购 | 151 | -5.1 | 1.89 | 5.46 | 8.36 | 14.2\n自产 | 507 | -11.5 | 2.58 | 6.06 | 9.22 | 19.1\n非生产物料 | 22 | -2.5 | 2.52 | 5.65 | 7.99 | 13.1\n(3 rows)", "id": "af4cf8fefaeb4402ae4ea4e1c9464807", "created_at": "2026-09-18T00:11:08.783123", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T00:11:08.784408", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Good. Note the transit p90 equals max — because of the discrete percentile method with small n... Actually 华东公路 n=241, p90=10.0 and max=10.0 — suspicious: transit capped at 10 days for 公路? Possibly data generated with caps. Fine.\n\nNow write the script. Key logic:\n\n在途 (open shipments):\n- For each order, for each open shipment: allowed = promise − dispatched_at (days).\n- Route transit distribution D_r (completed shipments on same route). p_late = P(d > allowed) with continuity: use empirical fraction with strict >; if allowed ≥ max → small nonzero? Use Laplace-ish smoothing? Keep raw empirical but disclose; if p=0 report 0.00 and note \"样本内无更慢案例\".\n- Fallback chain: route (n≥5) → transport_mode (n≥5) → all.\n- Expected receipt P50/P90 = dispatched_at + p50/p90 of D.\n- Order-level: worst shipment (max p_late), latest P50/P90.\n\n未发货:\n- pred_receipt = SHIP planned_end + transit_p50(route) [+ err_p50 for P50 estimate].\n  Let me define: point estimate P50 receipt = ship_plan + transit_p50 + err_p50(mode); P90 = ship_plan + transit_p50 + err_p90(mode).\n  Hmm, mixing. Cleaner: define model prediction pred = ship_plan + transit_p50; err distribution gives quantiles of (actual − pred). So P50 receipt = pred + err_p50, P90 = pred + err_p90. buffer = promise − pred. p_late = P(err > buffer).\n- Fallback: mode n≥5 else all.\n\nAlso for 未发货 orders where SHIP node has actual_end (dispatched) — those are in 在途 group by definition of open shipment. But there could be orders where SHIP node actual_end exists and all shipments received but qty < order qty (partial). Our classification: 已发部分已签收,余量未发 → count 0 in that bucket (the 1 partial had open shipment). Good.\n\nOverdue fact: promise < snapshot and not fully signed → level \"红-延期事实\", score forced 1.0, listed separately.\n\nSignals (evidence columns):\n- 在途: last logistics event status, count of 运输延误/异常 events, carrier_promised_at vs promise, open exceptions (severity).\n- 未发货: overdue open nodes count & max overdue days, current stage/status, open PO with supplier ETA later than promised receipt (eta_late days), bad QC count, open exceptions, ERP source_risk_flag/reason (kept as raw, per config source_risk_usage=仅保留原始标记).\n\nOutput: md + csv. Also print summary.\n\nLet me write the script carefully. I'll use sqlite3 read-only.\n\nFor percentile: use the same discrete method as before (rn = int(n*q)+1) for consistency.\n\nFor P(err > buffer): empirical fraction of err values strictly greater than buffer. Add small smoothing? I'll report raw empirical and note sample size. To avoid 0.0 for extreme cases, I'll use (count + 0.5) / (n + 1)? That's Laplace-ish and defensible but changes numbers. Hmm. Prior artifact gave p_buffer 0.267 etc. I'll use raw empirical but floor at 1/(n+1)... Let me just use raw empirical with a documented note: \"经验概率，样本外不外推；P=0 表示该桶历史样本中无更慢案例（样本量 n）\". Actually for a risk board, a hard 0 is misleading. I'll use the \"add-one smoothing on the tail\": p = (k + 1) / (n + 2)? That's Beta(1,1) posterior mean — defensible and documented. Let me use Beta(1,1) posterior mean: p = (k+1)/(n+2). Document it.\n\nHmm, but then a very safe order gets p=1/(n+2)≈0.004 — fine, still 绿.\n\nLet me now also handle: 未发货 order with no SHIP node planned_end (null)? Check. And orders with promise already passed → overdue fact.\n\nLet me write it.", "id": "1b6a5615e7cb45ff883da15143cc437b", "created_at": "2026-09-18T00:11:11.833451", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_43ab6bd60a1a48cc8ea6b9b2", "name": "write_file", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"datahub/scripts/delivery_risk.py\", \"content\": \"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"在途 / 未发货订单 交付风险红黄绿评分（需求2）\\n\\n口径（datahub/docs/业务口径要点.md · 风险预警口径）：\\n  · 固定时点 = configuration.snapshot_at（不用机器时间）\\n  · 订单完成 = 全量签收；分批发货按运单量累计，未收满即仍在风险敞口内\\n  · 红 ≥ risk_red_threshold(0.65)；黄 ≥ risk_yellow_threshold(0.30)；其余绿\\n  · 承诺日期已过且未全量签收 = 已发生的延期事实，单独标 \\\"红-延期事实\\\"，不包装成预测\\n  · 概率为经验概率/演示评分，未经真实数据校准；样本量与外推不足必须披露\\n\\n方法（全部由 SQL 聚合算出，可复算）：\\n  A. 在途（有已发未签运单）\\n     允许在途天数 allowed = 承诺交期 − 发货时间\\n     经验分布 D = 同线路历史已签收运单的在途天数（线路 n<min_samples 退到运输方式，再退到全网）\\n     P(延期) = P(d > allowed)，Beta(1,1) 平滑：p=(k+1)/(n+2)\\n     P50/P90 预计签收 = 发货时间 + D 的 P50/P90\\n  B. 未发货（无任何运单）\\n     预测签收 pred = 发货节点计划完成(SHIP planned_end) + 线路在途 P50\\n     残差经验分布 E = 历史已全量签收订单的 (实际签收 − pred)，按履约方式分桶\\n     buffer = 承诺交期 − pred ；P(延期) = P(e > buffer)，同样平滑\\n     P50/P90 预计签收 = pred + E 的 P50/P90\\n  辅助信号（只作依据展示，不参与打分，避免未校准的加权）：\\n     超时未完节点、当前节点、供应商 ETA 晚于采购承诺、不合格质检、未关闭异常、\\n     物流延误事件、承运商承诺晚于客户承诺、ERP 原始风险标记（仅保留原始标记）\\n\\n用法: python3 delivery_risk.py [--db PATH] [--out DIR] [--csv]\\n输出: delivery_risk_<YYYYMMDD>.md / .csv\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport argparse\\nimport csv\\nimport json\\nimport os\\nimport sqlite3\\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta, timezone\\n\\nMIN_SAMPLES_KEY = \\\"risk_min_samples\\\"\\nSNAP_KEY = \\\"snapshot_at\\\"\\n\\n\\n# ---------- helpers ----------\\ndef cfg(con):\\n    return dict(con.execute(\\\"SELECT config_key, config_value FROM configuration\\\").fetchall())\\n\\n\\ndef jd(iso):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"ISO(带+08:00) -> 儒略日浮点，用 UTC epoch 天数差即可（同一时区基准）。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    if not iso:\\n        return None\\n    s = iso.replace(\\\"T\\\", \\\" \\\").replace(\\\"+08:00\\\", \\\"\\\").replace(\\\"+00:00\\\", \\\"\\\")\\n    return datetime.fromisoformat(s).timestamp() / 86400.0\\n\\n\\ndef fmt(j):\\n    return (datetime.fromtimestamp(j * 86400, timezone(timedelta(hours=8)))\\n            .strftime(\\\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M\\\")) if j is not None else \\\"-\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef quant(sorted_vals, q):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"离散分位：rn = int(n*q)+1（与历史口径一致）。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    if not sorted_vals:\\n        return None\\n    n = len(sorted_vals)\\n    i = min(max(int(n * q) + 1, 1), n)\\n    return sorted_vals[i - 1]\\n\\n\\ndef beta_p(vals, thr, strict_greater=True):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"经验 P(x > thr)，Beta(1,1) 平滑。返回 (p, k, n)。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    n = len(vals)\\n    k = sum(1 for v in vals if v > thr) if strict_greater else sum(1 for v in vals if v >= thr)\\n    return (k + 1.0) / (n + 2.0), k, n\\n\\n\\ndef find_db(explicit=None):\\n    here = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\\n    for c in [explicit,\\n              os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \\\"datahub\\\", \\\"agent_data.sqlite\\\"),\\n              os.path.join(here, \\\"agent_data.sqlite\\\")]:\\n        if c and os.path.isfile(c):\\n            return c\\n    raise SystemExit(\\\"agent_data.sqlite not found\\\")\\n\\n\\n# ---------- data loading ----------\\ndef load(con):\\n    orders = {}\\n    for r in con.execute(\\\"\\\"\\\"SELECT o.sales_order_id,o.work_order_id,o.customer_id,o.product_id,\\n            o.quantity,o.unit,o.contract_amount,o.promised_delivery_at,o.route_id,o.fulfillment_mode,\\n            o.delivery_basis,o.source_risk_flag,o.source_risk_reason,o.created_at,\\n            c.customer_name,c.customer_tier,rt.route_name,rt.transport_mode,rt.baseline_transit_days,p.product_name\\n        FROM orders o\\n        LEFT JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id=o.customer_id\\n        LEFT JOIN routes rt ON rt.route_id=o.route_id\\n        LEFT JOIN products p ON p.product_id=o.product_id\\n        WHERE o.is_effective=1\\\"\\\"\\\"):\\n        orders[r[0]] = dict(zip([k for k in (\\\"sales_order_id\\\", \\\"work_order_id\\\", \\\"customer_id\\\", \\\"product_id\\\",\\n                                             \\\"quantity\\\", \\\"unit\\\", \\\"contract_amount\\\", \\\"promised\\\", \\\"route_id\\\",\\n                                             \\\"mode\\\", \\\"delivery_basis\\\", \\\"src_flag\\\", \\\"src_reason\\\", \\\"created\\\",\\n                                             \\\"customer\\\", \\\"tier\\\", \\\"route_name\\\", \\\"tmode\\\", \\\"base_transit\\\",\\n                                             \\\"product\\\")], r))\\n\\n    ships = [dict(zip((\\\"shipment_id\\\", \\\"sales_order_id\\\", \\\"route_id\\\", \\\"carrier\\\", \\\"quantity\\\", \\\"unit\\\",\\n                       \\\"dispatched_at\\\", \\\"carrier_promised_at\\\", \\\"received_at\\\", \\\"status\\\"), r))\\n             for r in con.execute(\\\"SELECT shipment_id,sales_order_id,route_id,carrier,quantity,unit,\\\"\\n                                  \\\"dispatched_at,carrier_promised_at,received_at,status FROM shipments\\\")]\\n\\n    nodes = [dict(zip((\\\"sales_order_id\\\", \\\"stage_code\\\", \\\"stage_name\\\", \\\"sequence\\\", \\\"planned_end_at\\\",\\n                       \\\"actual_end_at\\\", \\\"stage_status\\\"), r))\\n             for r in con.execute(\\\"SELECT sales_order_id,stage_code,stage_name,sequence,planned_end_at,\\\"\\n                                  \\\"actual_end_at,stage_status FROM stage_nodes ORDER BY sales_order_id,sequence\\\")]\\n\\n    exc = [dict(zip((\\\"sales_order_id\\\", \\\"severity\\\", \\\"exception_type\\\", \\\"opened_at\\\", \\\"closed_at\\\", \\\"status\\\"), r))\\n           for r in con.execute(\\\"SELECT sales_order_id,severity,exception_type,opened_at,closed_at,status \\\"\\n                                \\\"FROM exceptions\\\")]\\n\\n    ev = [dict(zip((\\\"shipment_id\\\", \\\"event_at\\\", \\\"event_status\\\"), r))\\n          for r in con.execute(\\\"SELECT shipment_id,event_at,event_status FROM logistics_events\\\")]\\n\\n    po = [dict(zip((\\\"sales_order_id\\\", \\\"actual_receipt_at\\\", \\\"promised_receipt_at\\\", \\\"supplier_confirmed_eta\\\"), r))\\n          for r in con.execute(\\\"SELECT sales_order_id,actual_receipt_at,promised_receipt_at,supplier_confirmed_eta \\\"\\n                               \\\"FROM procurement_lines\\\")]\\n\\n    qc = con.execute(\\\"SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) FROM quality_inspections WHERE result='不合格' \\\"\\n                     \\\"GROUP BY 1\\\").fetchall()\\n    return orders, ships, nodes, exc, ev, po, dict(qc)\\n\\n\\n# ---------- empirical distributions ----------\\ndef transit_by_route(ships):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"route_id -> [在途天数]（已签收且已发货）\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    d = {}\\n    for s in ships:\\n        if s[\\\"received_at\\\"] and s[\\\"dispatched_at\\\"]:\\n            d.setdefault(s[\\\"route_id\\\"], []).append(jd(s[\\\"received_at\\\"]) - jd(s[\\\"dispatched_at\\\"]))\\n    return d\\n\\n\\ndef err_by_mode(orders, ships, nodes, tr):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"历史已全量签收订单：残差 = 实际签收 − (SHIP计划完成 + 线路在途P50)\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    disp, recv = {}, {}\\n    for s in ships:\\n        disp[s[\\\"sales_order_id\\\"]] = disp.get(s[\\\"sales_order_id\\\"], 0) + s[\\\"quantity\\\"]\\n        if s[\\\"received_at\\\"]:\\n            recv[s[\\\"sales_order_id\\\"]] = recv.get(s[\\\"sales_order_id\\\"], 0) + s[\\\"quantity\\\"]\\n    ship_plan = {k: v for k, v in\\n                 ((n[\\\"sales_order_id\\\"], n[\\\"planned_end_at\\\"]) for n in nodes if n[\\\"stage_code\\\"] == \\\"SHIP\\\")}\\n    p50 = {r: quant(sorted(v), 0.5) for r, v in tr.items()}\\n    allp50 = quant(sorted([x for v in tr.values() for x in v]), 0.5)\\n    out = {}\\n    for oid, o in orders.items():\\n        if recv.get(oid, 0) < o[\\\"quantity\\\"]:\\n            continue                      # 只用已全量签收的历史单做标定\\n        sp = ship_plan.get(oid)\\n        if not sp:\\n            continue\\n        pred = jd(sp) + (p50.get(o[\\\"route_id\\\"]) or allp50)\\n        out.setdefault(o[\\\"mode\\\"], []).append(jd(recv[oid]) - pred)\\n    return out\\n\\n\\n# ---------- per-order signals ----------\\ndef node_signals(nodes_for_order, snap):\\n    open_nodes = [n for n in nodes_for_order if not n[\\\"actual_end_at\\\"]]\\n    overdue = [n for n in open_nodes if jd(n[\\\"planned_end_at\\\"]) < snap]\\n    cur = min(open_nodes, key=lambda n: n[\\\"sequence\\\"]) if open_nodes else None\\n    return {\\n        \\\"open_nodes\\\": len(open_nodes),\\n        \\\"overdue_nodes\\\": len(overdue),\\n        \\\"max_overdue_d\\\": round(max((snap - jd(n[\\\"planned_end_at\\\"]) for n in overdue), default=0.0), 1),\\n        \\\"cur_stage\\\": cur[\\\"stage_name\\\"] if cur else \\\"已全量发运\\\",\\n        \\\"cur_status\\\": cur[\\\"stage_status\\\"] if cur else \\\"-\\\",\\n        \\\"ship_plan\\\": next((n[\\\"planned_end_at\\\"] for n in nodes_for_or